with or endorsed by VRChat Inc.", "short_description": "Your VRChat companion on Quest \u2014 browse & equip avatars, manage favourites, friends, worlds, plus OSC chatbox, avatar controls & visual scripting.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XnotCykoX/vrc-nexus-quest/main/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "_cykoo_", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrc-nexus.online/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1114781715061235"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1015580800912690"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1015580800912690"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781571300, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1015580800912690"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1194499260422813", "version": "0.4.74"}, "id": "1305431047944649", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1114160378456702", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1194499260422813"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1305431047944649"}]}, "change_log": "fixed vrchat account sign in", "created_date": 1785885967, "id": "1194499260422813", "version": "0.4.74", "version_code": 119, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1114160378456702", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1194499260422813"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1305431047944649"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785823447, "id": "1193318773874195", "version": "0.4.71", "version_code": 116, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1114160378456702", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1194499260422813"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1305431047944649"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1785764220, "id": "1192125647326841", "version": "0.4.62", "version_code": 107, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1114160378456702", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1194499260422813"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1305431047944649"}]}, "change_log": ":rocket: VRC-NEXUS Quest \u2014 What's New\r\n\r\n:musical_note: Now-Playing / Media \u2014 a whole new setup\r\n\r\n- :new: Choose your music source \u2014 new Source dropdown, and the methods are mutually exclusive (so a rate-limited Last.fm can't block the others):\r\n  - Notification access (headset media) \u2014 the default, and imo the best method.\r\n  - Last.fm \u2014 any device, free.\r\n  - Spotify (Premium) \u2014 re-added; your own Spotify app via OAuth.\r\n  - :boom: Discord (Spotify) \u2014 see below, it's a big one.\r\n- Small characters for the media time played (superscript \u2070\u00b9\u00b2 / subscript \u2080\u2081\u2082).\r\n- Toggleable small \"\u1d2e\u02b8\" \u2014 show now-playing as [song] \u1d2e\u02b8 [author].\r\n- Hide the author to save characters (shows just the song name).\r\n\r\n:bar_chart: Progress bar upgrades\r\n\r\n- Times now sit on each side of the bar when shown (1:23 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2591 3:45) \u2014 minimises characters.\r\n- Bar defaults to size 9 to save room.\r\n- Put the bar on its own separate line if you prefer.\r\n\r\n:clock1: Chatbox formatting\r\n\r\n- Small numbers (and letters) for current time and session uptime too \u2014 the whole thing shrinks so it matches (e.g. \u1d41\u1d56 \u00b3\u02b0 \u00b2\u2070\u1d50).\r\n\r\n:white_sun_rain_cloud: Weather\r\n\r\n- Defaults to just the temperature \u2014 and you can now hide your location.\r\n- Individual toggles: location, peak temps (high & low), and condition (rainy/cloudy/etc).\r\n- Much more reliable city search (two-pass lookup \u2014 handles misspellings & small towns; still testing very complex locations).\r\n\r\n:earth_africa: Community Hub\r\n\r\n- Search by name, author, or tag.\r\n- Publish under your own name (remembered) instead of Anonymous.\r\n- Massively improved reliability \u2014 you should never see the HTTP 403 error again.\r\n\r\n:shield: Reliability & performance\r\n\r\n- \"Run in background\" prompt on first open so the chatbox/OSC keep updating while you're in VRChat.\r\n- Last.fm hardened for scale \u2014 adaptive polling + back-off, and it only polls when Last.fm is actually your selected source (stops the shared key getting rate-limited).\r\n\r\n---\r\n:boom: MASSIVE ADDITION \u2014 NEW MEDIA METHOD: Discord (Spotify)\r\n\r\nI noticed one of our competitors had this, so I built our own version \u2014 introducing the Discord method.\r\n\r\nAll you need is Spotify connected to your Discord (Settings \u2192 Connections \u2192 Spotify). Once that's done:\r\n1. Join the VRC-NEXUS Discord (one-tap Join button in-app) so our bot can see your status,\r\n2. Paste your Discord user ID into the app (completely safe, dw)", "created_date": 1785655651, "id": "1190149977524408", "version": "0.4.38", "version_code": 83, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1114160378456702", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1194499260422813"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1305431047944649"}]}, "change_log": "VRC-NEXUS Quest \u2014 What's New\r\n\r\n\ufffd Now-playing music is way easier to set up\r\n\r\n- New first-run walkthrough \u2014 the first time you open the Chatbox tab, a step-by-step guide pops up and walks you through getting music working, with a picture of each screen:\r\n  a. Toggle media integration \u2014 turn on Now playing (device) (with a one-tap button that does it for you).\r\n  b. Grant notification access \u2014 opens the correct Quest screen; just toggle VRC-NEXUS on.\r\n  c. Done \u2014 play any media on your Quest and it shows in your chatbox automatically.\r\n  d. Optional \u2014 want music from your phone/PC instead? Connect Last.fm (free, no login).\r\n- Back / Next / Skip navigation with progress dots, and it only shows once.\r\n- Replay anytime with the new \ufffd Setup guide button in the now-playing options.\r\n\r\n\ufffd Working \"Notification access\" button (no Developer Mode / ADB)", "created_date": 1785300232, "id": "1183329421539797", "version": "0.4.27", "version_code": 72, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}